<div class="limora-moodboard page-width">
  <header class="limora-moodboard__header">
    <p class="limora-moodboard__eyebrow">BRAND MOODBOARD</p>
    <h1 class="limora-moodboard__title">LIMORA <span>リモラ</span></h1>
    <p class="limora-moodboard__concept">「毎日の服選びを少しだけ軽くする」</p>
    <p class="limora-moodboard__lead">
      忙しい20代女性に向けた、韓国カジュアルとナチュラルテイストを融合したデイリーウェアブランド。<br>
      トレンドを取り入れながらも、長く着られるデザインを提案する。
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="limora-moodboard__block">
    <h2 class="limora-moodboard__heading">Keywords</h2>
    <ul class="limora-moodboard__keywords">
      <li>Natural</li>
      <li>Casual</li>
      <li>Soft</li>
      <li>Korean Mood</li>
      <li>Everyday</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="limora-moodboard__block">
    <h2 class="limora-moodboard__heading">Color Palette</h2>
    <ul class="limora-moodboard__palette">
      <li>
        <span class="limora-moodboard__swatch" style="background-color: #FAF6F0;"></span>
        <span class="limora-moodboard__swatch-name">Ivory / アイボリー</span>
        <span class="limora-moodboard__swatch-hex">#FAF6F0</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="limora-moodboard__swatch" style="background-color: #EFE3D3;"></span>
        <span class="limora-moodboard__swatch-name">Beige / ベージュ</span>
        <span class="limora-moodboard__swatch-hex">#EFE3D3</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="limora-moodboard__swatch" style="background-color: #A3B18A;"></span>
        <span class="limora-moodboard__swatch-name">Sage Green / セージグリーン</span>
        <span class="limora-moodboard__swatch-hex">#A3B18A</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="limora-moodboard__swatch" style="background-color: #6B5B4D;"></span>
        <span class="limora-moodboard__swatch-name">Brown / ブラウン</span>
        <span class="limora-moodboard__swatch-hex">#6B5B4D</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="limora-moodboard__block">
    <h2 class="limora-moodboard__heading">Typography</h2>
    <div class="limora-moodboard__type">
      <p class="limora-moodboard__type-sample limora-moodboard__type-sample--heading">Aa あ 가 LIMORA</p>
      <p class="limora-moodboard__type-caption">見出し: Jost — シャープで都会的なジオメトリックサンセリフ</p>
      <p class="limora-moodboard__type-sample limora-moodboard__type-sample--body">毎日の服選びを少しだけ軽くする。Everyday natural style.</p>
      <p class="limora-moodboard__type-caption">本文: Poppins — 丸みのある柔らかい印象のサンセリフ</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="limora-moodboard__block">
    <h2 class="limora-moodboard__heading">Mood Imagery</h2>
    <p class="limora-moodboard__note">※ 実写素材が決まり次第、下記プレースホルダーに差し替えてください。</p>
    <ul class="limora-moodboard__imagery">
      <li style="background: linear-gradient(160deg, #EFE3D3, #FAF6F0);">韓国カジュアルコーデ</li>
      <li style="background: linear-gradient(160deg, #A3B18A, #EFE3D3);">ナチュラル素材のディテール</li>
      <li style="background: linear-gradient(160deg, #6B5B4D, #A3B18A);">都会のカフェでの日常</li>
      <li style="background: linear-gradient(160deg, #FAF6F0, #6B5B4D);">柔らかい質感のスタイリング</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="limora-moodboard__block">
    <h2 class="limora-moodboard__heading">Persona</h2>
    <div class="limora-moodboard__persona">
      <p class="limora-moodboard__persona-name">田中美咲（27歳）</p>
      <ul class="limora-moodboard__persona-list">
        <li>IT企業勤務・年収420万円</li>
        <li>都市部在住、Instagram利用頻度高め</li>
        <li>休日はカフェ巡りが好き</li>
        <li>シンプルだけどおしゃれに見える服を求めている</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% style %}
  .limora-moodboard {
    padding-top: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
    color: #4A3F35;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin: 0 auto 4rem;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__eyebrow {
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #A3B18A;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__title {
    font-size: 4.4rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    color: #4A3F35;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__title span {
    font-size: 0.5em;
    color: #6B5B4D;
    margin-left: 0.6rem;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__concept {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
    color: #6B5B4D;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__lead {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #4A3F35;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__block {
    max-width: 64rem;
    margin: 0 auto 4rem;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__heading {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #D8CBB8;
    color: #4A3F35;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__keywords {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__keywords li {
    padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: #EFE3D3;
    color: #4A3F35;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__palette {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1.6rem;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__palette li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__swatch {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 8rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(74, 63, 53, 0.12);
  }

  .limora-moodboard__swatch-name {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__swatch-hex {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #6B5B4D;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__type {
    background-color: #EFE3D3;
    border-radius: 1.2rem;
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__type-sample {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__type-sample--heading {
    font-size: 3.2rem;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__type-sample--body {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__type-caption {
    margin: 0 0 2.4rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #6B5B4D;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__type-caption:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__note {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #6B5B4D;
    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__imagery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(18rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1.6rem;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__imagery li {
    height: 16rem;
    border-radius: 1.2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding: 1.6rem;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: #4A3F35;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(250, 246, 240, 0.6);
  }

  .limora-moodboard__persona {
    background-color: #FAF6F0;
    border: 1px solid #D8CBB8;
    border-radius: 1.2rem;
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__persona-name {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
  }

  .limora-moodboard__persona-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: #4A3F35;
  }
{% endstyle %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "LIMORA ムードボード",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
